-- A call script for examples/chains.lang (S7 s2, Q-S7-6 (a)). The env line
-- gives the chain id and the contract address of each call: chain 1 and the
-- receiver address of test/evmchain.sh, thus the chain test of test/evm.sh
-- reads the same values with CHAINID and ADDRESS.
env 1u 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
1 1u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb stamp
2 2u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb onlyAt 1u 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
3 3u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb onlyAt 2u 0x0000000000000000000000007265636569766572
4 4u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb onlyAt 1u 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000c1
